## State

The plan lives in the issue, the handoff in the PR body. `.ai/` is gitignored scratch space. Body files for `just` go in `.ai/forge/`; do not tidy or delete anything else there — the human may keep notes and scripts in it across sessions. Nothing that matters exists only in `.ai/`, and committed files never reference it.
